OL,3,GNEWSATurbine would be 'three times
OL,4,Alarger than Orwell Bridge'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA150m-high wind turbine on the
OL,7,Foutskirts of Ipswich would be twice the
OL,8,Fheight of Suffolk's tallest building if
OL,9,Fconstructed, a council report found.
OL,11,FAssociated British Ports (ABP), which
OL,12,Fowns and operates the Port of Ipswich,
OL,13,Fis preparing plans for the structure at
OL,14,FCliff Quay, near Orwell Bridge.
OL,16,FThe company has requested a screening
OL,17,Fopinion from Babergh District Council
OL,18,Fbefore a full planning application is
OL,19,Fsubmitted.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
