OL,3,GNEWSATurbine would be 'three times
OL,4,Alarger than Orwell Bridge'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Martin Cook, who represents
OL,7,Fthe Gainsborough ward at Ipswich
OL,8,FBorough Council, said the structure
OL,9,Fwould be "three and a half times the
OL,10,FOrwell Bridge, more than twice The Mill
OL,11,Fon the Waterfront and equal to the
OL,12,Ftallest onshore wind turbine in
OL,13,FEngland."
